  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eu kahve fallar\u0131n\u0131n her \u015Feyi oldu\u011Fu gibi ve fevkalade
    kapsaml\u0131 bir \u015Fekilde yans\u0131tmas\u0131n\u0131 \xE7ok seviyorum!
    Bug\xFCnlerde bir sa\u011Fl\u0131k problemini, payla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131
    bir g\xF6rselle ya da yaz\u0131yla sosyal medyaya yans\u0131tan ve senin de bu
    sorundan bu \u015Fekilde haber ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n biriyle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131n
    m\u0131? Hen\xFCz kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Fmad\u0131ysan, birka\xE7 g\xFCn i\xE7inde
    kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Fmak \xFCzeresin {{isim}}. Telvelerin, yak\u0131nda bu
    ki\u015Finin sana bir itirafta bulunaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor. Duyacaklar\u0131na
    hem \u015Fa\u015F\u0131racak, hem memnun olacak, hem de baz\u0131 hislerinde
    yan\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve \xF6nyarg\u0131l\u0131 davrand\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    anlayacaks\u0131n."
